      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$PQ = \\sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2}$$\n$$= \\sqrt{(2 - 1)^2 + (2 - 1)^2}$$\n$$= \\sqrt{1^2 + 1^2}$$\n$$= \\sqrt{1 + 1} = \\sqrt{2}$$",
