      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c11-t11.2-p032",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$AB$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য $= \\sqrt{(-2 - 0)^2 + (3 - (-1))^2}$\n$= \\sqrt{(-2)^2 + (4)^2} = \\sqrt{4 + 16} = 2\\sqrt{5}$ একক\n$CD$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য $= \\sqrt{(8 - 6)^2 + (3 - 7)^2}$\n$= \\sqrt{4 + 16} = 2\\sqrt{5}$ একক\n$\\therefore AB$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য $= CD$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য\nআবার,\n$AD$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য $= \\sqrt{(8 - 0)^2 + (3 - (-1))^2}$\n$= \\sqrt{8^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{80} = 4\\sqrt{5}$ একক\n$BC$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য $= \\sqrt{(6 - (-2))^2 + (7 - 3)^2}$\n$= \\sqrt{8^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{80} = 4\\sqrt{5}$ একক\n$\\therefore AD$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য $= BC$ বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য\n$\\therefore$ বিপরীত বাহুগুলোর দৈর্ঘ্য সমান।\nসুতরাং বলা যায়, $ABCD$ একটি সামানত্রিক।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "AB",
        "= \\sqrt{(-2 - 0)^2 + (3 - (-1))^2}",
        "= \\sqrt{(-2)^2 + (4)^2} = \\sqrt{4 + 16} = 2\\sqrt{5}",
        "CD",
        "= \\sqrt{(8 - 6)^2 + (3 - 7)^2}",
        "= \\sqrt{4 + 16} = 2\\sqrt{5}",
        "\\therefore AB",
        "= CD",
        "AD",
        "= \\sqrt{(8 - 0)^2 + (3 - (-1))^2}",
        "= \\sqrt{8^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{80} = 4\\sqrt{5}",
        "BC",
        "= \\sqrt{(6 - (-2))^2 + (7 - 3)^2}",
        "= \\sqrt{8^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{80} = 4\\sqrt{5}",
        "\\therefore AD",
        "= BC",
        "\\therefore",
        "ABCD"
      ],
